::Triggers Objectives::
A __________ is a special kind of a store procedure that executes in response to certain action on the table like insertion, deletion or updation of data.
{
    ~Functions
    ~Sequence
    =Triggers
    ~Procedure
}

::Triggers::
What are the after triggers?
{
    =Triggers that run after an insert, update or delete on a table
    ~Triggers generated after a particular operation
    ~Triggers that run after view on a table
    ~All of the above
}

::Triggers::
What are the different variation in triggers?
{
    ~Commit, Rollback
    =Insert, Update, Delete
    ~Grant, Revoke
    ~None of the above
}
